@startuml

!theme sunlust
top to bottom direction
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam package {
    backgroundColor #FFFFFF
    borderColor #555555
}
skinparam rectangle {
  backgroundColor #E6F3FF
  borderColor #3995D7
}

' =======================================
' Definizione dei Componenti dell'Architettura (usando sintassi base)
' =======================================

package "Flutter Client Architecture (MVVM/BLoC)" {

    ' --- View Layer ---
    rectangle "**View**\n(UI Widgets)" as View

    ' --- ViewModel Layer ---
    rectangle "**ViewModel**\n(BLoC)" as BLoC

    ' --- Model Layer ---
    rectangle "**Model**\n(Repository)" as Repository

    ' --- Backend (esterno al client) ---
    database "Backend\n(Supabase RPC/Edge)" as Backend
}

' =======================================
' Definizione del Flusso di Dati e di Eventi
' =======================================

' 1. User interaction triggers an Event
View -> BLoC : 1. Notifies **Event**\n(e.g., Button Pressed)

' 2. BLoC processes the event, calls Repository
BLoC -> Repository : 2. Calls method\n(e.g., fetchData())

' 3. Repository fetches data from the backend
Repository -> Backend : 3. Makes API call

' 4. Repository returns data to BLoC
Backend --> Repository : 4. Returns Data
Repository --> BLoC : 5. Returns Data (Entities/Bundles)

' 5. BLoC creates a new State and emits it
' La freccia tratteggiata indica una dipendenza di "ascolto"
View <.. BLoC : 7. Listens to **State** stream

' La freccia che torna indietro indica l'emissione dello stato
BLoC -> BLoC : 6. Creates new **State**
note right of BLoC : Processes logic and\nemits a new State

@enduml